{"url": "（本地文件）003、第三节：运用形容词所有格描述所属关系.mp4", "link": false, "lang": "zh", "local_path": "G:\\【瑞杰老师】全能英语课程\\瑞杰老师 30 天英语实战训练营(1)\\003、第三节：运用形容词所有格描述所属关系.mp4", "segments": [{"start": 11.58, "text": "上节课,the last lesson", "end": 13.74}, {"start": 13.74, "text": "我们探索了指示物品,指定物品。", "end": 18.43}, {"start": 18.43, "text": "This is something, this is a microphone, that is a light。", "end": 22.86}, {"start": 22.86, "text": "今天我们将进一步深化这个概念,表达一个东西是有所属的,是属于我或者属于某个人的。", "end": 31.82}, {"start": 31.82, "text": "好,那我们进一步把代词用出来。", "end": 35.38}, {"start": 35.38, "text": "所以我们直接进入正题,请看这个男人,他指着头看着你说。", "end": 42.06}, {"start": 42.06, "text": "This is my head, this,我们上节课刚讲的。", "end": 49.99}, {"start": 49.99, "text": "This, that,这个, this,那个, that。", "end": 54.99}, {"start": 54.99, "text": "This is my head, this is my nose, this is my mouth, this。", "end": 64.46}, {"start": 64.46, "text": "注意,他这里为了代表是我的,他不再用I了。", "end": 70.05}, {"start": 70.05, "text": "I指代的是自己这个本体,但如果是我的,英语会讲my。", "end": 75.85}, {"start": 75.85, "text": "This is my head,明白了吗?", "end": 80.3}, {"start": 80.3, "text": "好,那这个人指着帽子说。", "end": 83.3}, {"start": 83.3, "text": "This is my hat, this is my hat。", "end": 90.22}, {"start": 90.22, "text": "这里也用了my,帽子在手里。", "end": 94.64}, {"start": 94.64, "text": "My hat is in my hand,我们刚学的词hand。", "end": 101.87}, {"start": 101.87, "text": "My hat is in my hand, it is in my hand。", "end": 110.16}, {"start": 110.16, "text": "It, my hat既可以说出来hat,也可以说it。", "end": 116.49}, {"start": 116.49, "text": "I, you, he, she, they, it。", "end": 122.89}, {"start": 122.89, "text": "这是一个物品,而且只有一个。", "end": 126.48}, {"start": 126.48, "text": "It is in my hands, hands。", "end": 131.07}, {"start": 131.07, "text": "This hat is in my hand, it is in my hand。", "end": 137.5}, {"start": 137.5, "text": "明白了吗?", "end": 138.5}, {"start": 138.5, "text": "My hat is on my head。", "end": 142.1}, {"start": 144.87, "text": "It is on my head。", "end": 148.67}, {"start": 148.67, "text": "My hat is on my head。", "end": 153.12}, {"start": 153.12, "text": "It is on my head。", "end": 156.52}, {"start": 156.52, "text": "现在这个男人说this is my。", "end": 163.05}, {"start": 163.05, "text": "现在帽子不是自己的啦,是别人的帽子。", "end": 168.17}, {"start": 168.17, "text": "That is his hat。", "end": 172.55}, {"start": 172.55, "text": "这个男人叫his,就像I。", "end": 178.42}, {"start": 178.42, "text": "He, I am a man, he is a man。", "end": 183.34}, {"start": 183.34, "text": "我是男人,他也是男人。", "end": 187.06}, {"start": 187.06, "text": "My hat, his hat。", "end": 193.54}, {"start": 193.54, "text": "My hat, his hat。", "end": 198.69}, {"start": 198.69, "text": "That, 那个。", "end": 200.69}, {"start": 200.69, "text": "That is his hat。", "end": 203.69}, {"start": 203.69, "text": "我们指着他的头跟别人说。", "end": 206.29}, {"start": 206.29, "text": "Hey look, look, his hat is on his head。", "end": 216.14}, {"start": 216.14, "text": "His hat is on, on his head。", "end": 222.12}, {"start": 222.12, "text": "His hat is on his head。", "end": 228.02}, {"start": 228.02, "text": "他戴着这个帽子来。", "end": 229.82}, {"start": 229.82, "text": "万一是个女生呢?", "end": 232.42}, {"start": 232.42, "text": "我们快速复习一下。", "end": 235.24}, {"start": 235.24, "text": "My hat,男人his hat。", "end": 239.2}, {"start": 239.2, "text": "女生her hat。", "end": 242.61}, {"start": 242.61, "text": "She is a girl, her hat。", "end": 249.53}, {"start": 249.53, "text": "Her hat is on her hand, is in her hand。", "end": 252.73}, {"start": 252.73, "text": "不好意思。", "end": 254.26}, {"start": 254.26, "text": "Her hat is in her hand, her hat is in her hand。", "end": 262.82}, {"start": 262.82, "text": "Her hat is in her hand, my hat is on my head, his hat is on his head, her hat is in her hands。", "end": 279.53}, {"start": 279.53, "text": "大家会发现句子的长度跟复合程度会慢慢提高。", "end": 285.53}, {"start": 285.53, "text": "但是句子的成分全部都是我们在前面两节课里有覆盖到的。", "end": 291.33}, {"start": 291.33, "text": "Right?", "end": 292.33}, {"start": 292.33, "text": "所以这个课程是慢慢进阶的。", "end": 294.73}, {"start": 294.73, "text": "我还是要提醒在座的邻居也好学生也好。", "end": 298.93}, {"start": 298.93, "text": "耐心体验放开身心去接纳所有的语言信息。", "end": 305.82}, {"start": 305.82, "text": "不要稍微遇到不确定就开始背就开始着急。", "end": 310.22}, {"start": 310.22, "text": "所有这些概念我们在后续的学习里会一直反反复复的回顾。", "end": 316.02}, {"start": 316.02, "text": "等你整个课程30天上完,你的基本功就有了。", "end": 321.31}, {"start": 321.31, "text": "Don't worry。", "end": 322.31}, {"start": 322.31, "text": "好。", "end": 323.31}, {"start": 323.31, "text": "That is your hat, I my hat, you your hat, you your hat, I my hat, he his hat, she her hat, you your hat.", "end": 348.36}, {"start": 348.36, "text": "That is your hat, it is on the table.", "end": 352.16}, {"start": 352.36, "text": "It is on the table, it is on the table.", "end": 359.47}, {"start": 359.47, "text": "That is your hat, that is your hat, that is your hat, it is on the table.", "end": 372.79}, {"start": 372.79, "text": "好。", "end": 373.79}, {"start": 373.79, "text": "在这里我做个小小的暂停,帮大家缓一下,回顾一下。", "end": 379.79}, {"start": 379.79, "text": "I am a man, this is my hand, he is a man, that is his hand, she is a woman.", "end": 392.17}, {"start": 392.17, "text": "That is her hand.", "end": 396.37}, {"start": 396.37, "text": "注意,我这里说this和that都是一个。", "end": 400.37}, {"start": 400.37, "text": "万一我们要说两只手呢?", "end": 404.37}, {"start": 404.37, "text": "I am a man, these are my hands.", "end": 411.12}, {"start": 411.12, "text": "我们即将进入一个新的代词。", "end": 414.12}, {"start": 414.12, "text": "如果桌上只有一顶帽子,我们要怎么说?", "end": 418.12}, {"start": 418.12, "text": "That is a hat, it is on the table.", "end": 423.58}, {"start": 423.58, "text": "That is a hat, it is on the table.", "end": 428.8}, {"start": 428.8, "text": "万一有两顶呢?", "end": 430.8}, {"start": 430.8, "text": "这时候复述的我们就会说those hats are on the table.", "end": 444.9}, {"start": 444.9, "text": "那些帽子在桌上,他们在桌上。", "end": 456.42}, {"start": 456.42, "text": "所以你会发现复述的物体如果是一个。", "end": 460.42}, {"start": 460.42, "text": "我们说it,那是他的本体。", "end": 463.42}, {"start": 463.42, "text": "如果是they,那就是好多。", "end": 465.42}, {"start": 465.42, "text": "如果是these,指的就是这些东西。", "end": 468.42}, {"start": 468.42, "text": "如果是those,指的就是那些东西。", "end": 472.42}, {"start": 472.42, "text": "这四个代词要注意区分。", "end": 474.42}, {"start": 475.42, "text": "Those are your hats.", "end": 477.42}, {"start": 477.42, "text": "You have a hat, your hat.", "end": 482.53}, {"start": 482.53, "text": "This is my hat, this is your hat.", "end": 487.53}, {"start": 487.53, "text": "Those are your hats.", "end": 490.53}, {"start": 490.53, "text": "还跟他们说those are your hats.", "end": 496.95}, {"start": 496.95, "text": "They are on the table.", "end": 498.95}, {"start": 498.95, "text": "This is my hand, these are my hands.", "end": 506.5}, {"start": 506.5, "text": "This is my left hand, and this is my right hand.", "end": 511.0}, {"start": 511.0, "text": "Left hand, right hand.", "end": 515.74}, {"start": 515.74, "text": "These are my hands.", "end": 520.42}, {"start": 520.42, "text": "如果我不强调这些手,我只说他们,那我要怎么讲?", "end": 527.17}, {"start": 527.17, "text": "They are my hands.", "end": 530.74}, {"start": 530.74, "text": "区分清楚了吗?", "end": 531.74}, {"start": 531.74, "text": "你们的右手我要怎么说?", "end": 534.74}, {"start": 534.74, "text": "That is your right hand,你们的左手,that is your left hand.", "end": 541.78}, {"start": 541.78, "text": "Those are your hands.", "end": 544.78}, {"start": 544.78, "text": "最后听一遍。", "end": 548.79}, {"start": 548.79, "text": "That is your right hand, that is your left hand.", "end": 552.79}, {"start": 552.79, "text": "Those are your hands.", "end": 555.79}, {"start": 555.79, "text": "好,刚刚我们覆盖了英语大部分的代词。", "end": 559.79}, {"start": 559.79, "text": "你会发现每个语言精确取来,代词是比较多的。", "end": 564.79}, {"start": 564.79, "text": "不要去烦恼这个。", "end": 566.79}, {"start": 566.79, "text": "在后续的几十节课里面,包括未来,", "end": 570.79}, {"start": 570.79, "text": "你会反反复复的接触这些代词。", "end": 573.79}, {"start": 573.79, "text": "不要忘了Teacher Eric讲的原则,听懂就好。", "end": 578.35}, {"start": 578.35, "text": "一次理解,三次长期理解,五次终身运用。", "end": 585.35}, {"start": 585.35, "text": "不要想在一次里完成五次的事,慢慢跟着我走。", "end": 590.35}, {"start": 590.35, "text": "我答应过大家,我们会不断回顾。", "end": 594.35}, {"start": 594.35, "text": "所以我先问你们,What is this?", "end": 598.86}, {"start": 598.86, "text": "怎么回答?", "end": 601.44}, {"start": 609.3, "text": "Hat怎么拼?", "end": 610.3}, {"start": 614.98, "text": "一个女人。", "end": 615.98}, {"start": 615.98, "text": "那是她的帽子。", "end": 618.7}, {"start": 623.23, "text": "还是My hat。", "end": 625.7}, {"start": 625.7, "text": "这个不难。", "end": 627.29}, {"start": 627.29, "text": "Is this my hat?", "end": 629.72}, {"start": 629.72, "text": "His hat?", "end": 631.18}, {"start": 631.18, "text": "Or her hat?", "end": 633.18}, {"start": 633.18, "text": "This is her。", "end": 636.64}, {"start": 636.64, "text": "明白了吗?", "end": 639.58}, {"start": 639.58, "text": "第二次运用,你们的感觉已经上来了。", "end": 642.58}, {"start": 642.58, "text": "慢慢来。", "end": 643.58}, {"start": 643.58, "text": "她在说那个人。", "end": 647.07}, {"start": 647.07, "text": "那个东西已经不在这里了,在那里了。", "end": 652.07}, {"start": 652.07, "text": "只有一只手。", "end": 653.63}, {"start": 653.63, "text": "我们要说That is your hand?", "end": 656.63}, {"start": 656.63, "text": "还是Those are your hand?", "end": 659.63}, {"start": 659.63, "text": "记住,一个是That.", "end": 662.63}, {"start": 667.63, "text": "显然这是这个女人的右手。", "end": 669.63}, {"start": 679.62, "text": "所以她跟她这么说,如果是左手。", "end": 683.15}, {"start": 686.15, "text": "那我再问大家一个问题。", "end": 688.15}, {"start": 691.97, "text": "怎么回答?", "end": 693.85}, {"start": 696.02, "text": "Her hat is on her head。", "end": 701.77}, {"start": 701.77, "text": "她的帽在她的头上。", "end": 704.39}, {"start": 708.89, "text": "Hat怎么拼?", "end": 709.89}, {"start": 711.89, "text": "注意一个。", "end": 712.89}, {"start": 718.89, "text": "你看,其实你把字母发得很清楚的时候,拼写自然就解决了。", "end": 723.89}, {"start": 723.89, "text": "如果你发音都不清楚,你拼写就会出问题。", "end": 726.89}, {"start": 727.89, "text": "反之亦然。", "end": 728.89}, {"start": 728.89, "text": "所以我说听说读写要同步输入,同时输出。", "end": 732.89}, {"start": 732.89, "text": "你不要再区分成四个板块了。", "end": 735.89}, {"start": 737.89, "text": "截止到这里,我们把My, His, Her做了一个总结。", "end": 742.89}, {"start": 742.89, "text": "所以我说不要急,我们会反反复复的回顾。", "end": 745.89}, {"start": 745.89, "text": "代词会永远出现的。", "end": 747.89}, {"start": 747.89, "text": "在未来几十节课里全都会有。", "end": 750.89}, {"start": 750.89, "text": "你只要多用几遍,你就全区分清楚了。", "end": 753.89}, {"start": 753.89, "text": "这是你们的第二次运用。", "end": 756.89}, {"start": 756.89, "text": "好,我再问你们一题。", "end": 758.89}, {"start": 758.89, "text": "This is a man。", "end": 760.89}, {"start": 760.89, "text": "这是一个男人。", "end": 761.89}, {"start": 761.89, "text": "当然,有可能是boy。", "end": 763.89}, {"start": 763.89, "text": "Doesn't matter.", "end": 764.89}, {"start": 764.89, "text": "Where is his hat?", "end": 768.86}, {"start": 768.86, "text": "怎么回答?", "end": 770.78}, {"start": 770.78, "text": "His, his hat.", "end": 774.21}, {"start": 774.21, "text": "His hat.", "end": 775.21}, {"start": 776.06, "text": "He, his hat.", "end": 779.21}, {"start": 779.21, "text": "He, his hat.", "end": 781.96}, {"start": 781.96, "text": "我们问你Where is his hat?", "end": 783.96}, {"start": 783.96, "text": "His hat is in his hand.", "end": 788.84}, {"start": 788.84, "text": "His hat is in his hand.", "end": 793.2}, {"start": 793.2, "text": "这里是in, right?", "end": 796.2}, {"start": 796.2, "text": "On, in.", "end": 799.95}, {"start": 799.95, "text": "这是第一次接触in和on这两个截止。", "end": 802.95}, {"start": 802.95, "text": "找个感觉就好了。", "end": 804.95}, {"start": 804.95, "text": "好,那对于这两个人呢?", "end": 806.95}, {"start": 806.95, "text": "好,我们就不讨论帽子了。", "end": 808.95}, {"start": 808.95, "text": "看看这个man, this man, this man, that woman.", "end": 814.86}, {"start": 814.86, "text": "Where is this man's hand?", "end": 818.49}, {"start": 818.49, "text": "This man's hand is on his head.", "end": 828.14}, {"start": 828.14, "text": "The man's hand is on his head.", "end": 835.94}, {"start": 835.94, "text": "What about this man?", "end": 842.5}, {"start": 842.5, "text": "Where is his hand?", "end": 845.5}, {"start": 845.5, "text": "His hand.", "end": 847.58}, {"start": 847.58, "text": "He, his hand is on the table.", "end": 853.1}, {"start": 853.1, "text": "Table.", "end": 859.24}, {"start": 859.24, "text": "T-A-B-L-E", "end": 861.24}, {"start": 861.24, "text": "每个字母都发清楚。", "end": 863.24}, {"start": 863.24, "text": "你的发音就是对的。", "end": 864.24}, {"start": 864.24, "text": "你的拼写也就对了。", "end": 867.89}, {"start": 867.89, "text": "His hand is on the table.", "end": 870.93}, {"start": 870.93, "text": "不是in the table,是on the table.", "end": 873.93}, {"start": 873.93, "text": "Good。", "end": 875.9}, {"start": 875.9, "text": "现在我们进入一个小小的测试题。", "end": 879.9}, {"start": 879.9, "text": "我要照顾所有要应试的学生。", "end": 881.9}, {"start": 881.9, "text": "也给所有的想学好英语的人反复御用的机会。", "end": 886.9}, {"start": 886.9, "text": "这里有个图。", "end": 888.37}, {"start": 888.37, "text": "小狗的左耳红啦,太冷啦。", "end": 892.37}, {"start": 892.37, "text": "你们可以看到What season is it?", "end": 895.37}, {"start": 895.37, "text": "顺便学一下季节season。", "end": 897.37}, {"start": 897.37, "text": "What season is this?", "end": 899.37}, {"start": 900.37, "text": "你看这里就用掉this了。", "end": 902.37}, {"start": 902.37, "text": "这个画面。", "end": 904.37}, {"start": 904.37, "text": "This picture.", "end": 905.37}, {"start": 905.37, "text": "What season is it?", "end": 907.37}, {"start": 907.37, "text": "What season is this?", "end": 910.09}, {"start": 910.09, "text": "It is winter,冬天。", "end": 912.09}, {"start": 912.09, "text": "Someone's left ear is red.", "end": 916.06}, {"start": 916.06, "text": "Left ear is red,红色。", "end": 919.06}, {"start": 919.06, "text": "Are you cold?", "end": 921.06}, {"start": 921.06, "text": "注意这里有个线索。", "end": 923.06}, {"start": 923.06, "text": "Are you cold?", "end": 927.82}, {"start": 927.82, "text": "那要怎么说?", "end": 931.05}, {"start": 931.05, "text": "简然我在和你们对话。", "end": 933.05}, {"start": 933.05, "text": "所以我会说什么?", "end": 934.05}, {"start": 934.05, "text": "You left ear 还是your left ear?", "end": 938.05}, {"start": 938.05, "text": "Your left ear is red.", "end": 942.2}, {"start": 942.2, "text": "Are you cold?", "end": 945.7}, {"start": 945.7, "text": "是不是串起来了?", "end": 946.7}, {"start": 946.7, "text": "你的。", "end": 949.21}, {"start": 949.21, "text": "My right ear?", "end": 951.9}, {"start": 951.9, "text": "Your right ear.", "end": 954.78}, {"start": 954.78, "text": "Your right ear is cold.", "end": 956.78}, {"start": 956.78, "text": "Is red.", "end": 958.34}, {"start": 958.34, "text": "Are you cold?", "end": 959.34}, {"start": 959.34, "text": "所以是什么?", "end": 961.44}, {"start": 961.44, "text": "Your。", "end": 962.44}, {"start": 962.44, "text": "你的。", "end": 963.44}, {"start": 963.44, "text": "Right?", "end": 964.44}, {"start": 964.44, "text": "Your left ear is red.", "end": 967.44}, {"start": 967.44, "text": "在you的基础上加一个日的音。", "end": 970.44}, {"start": 970.44, "text": "就是are your.", "end": 973.44}, {"start": 973.44, "text": "That is hat.", "end": 976.77}, {"start": 976.77, "text": "He's wearing a cap.", "end": 978.77}, {"start": 978.77, "text": "cap跟hat差在哪里?", "end": 981.23}, {"start": 981.23, "text": "很多人不确定。", "end": 982.23}, {"start": 982.23, "text": "这个肯定是一个hat。", "end": 984.23}, {"start": 984.23, "text": "还有一个圆弧。", "end": 985.73}, {"start": 985.73, "text": "cap有点像什么?", "end": 986.73}, {"start": 986.73, "text": "鸭舌帽。", "end": 988.73}, {"start": 988.73, "text": "像我们打棒球那种帽子就叫cap。", "end": 991.73}, {"start": 991.73, "text": "当然这题它不做严格区分。", "end": 993.73}, {"start": 993.73, "text": "没关系。", "end": 994.73}, {"start": 994.73, "text": "我们就记得小帽子是cap。", "end": 996.73}, {"start": 996.73, "text": "正经的帽子是hat。", "end": 998.73}, {"start": 998.73, "text": "That is a.", "end": 999.73}, {"start": 999.73, "text": "That is cap.", "end": 1001.73}, {"start": 1001.73, "text": "He's wearing a cap.", "end": 1003.73}, {"start": 1003.73, "text": "He.", "end": 1004.73}, {"start": 1004.73, "text": "I.", "end": 1006.58}, {"start": 1006.58, "text": "He.", "end": 1008.07}, {"start": 1008.07, "text": "She.", "end": 1009.5}, {"start": 1009.5, "text": "他是男的还是女的?", "end": 1011.5}, {"start": 1011.5, "text": "He.", "end": 1013.06}, {"start": 1013.06, "text": "男生。", "end": 1014.06}, {"start": 1014.06, "text": "He is wearing a cap.", "end": 1017.06}, {"start": 1017.06, "text": "He is wearing a cap.", "end": 1020.2}, {"start": 1020.2, "text": "或者hat.", "end": 1021.2}, {"start": 1021.2, "text": "That is 谁的cap?", "end": 1025.9}, {"start": 1025.9, "text": "Whose cap is it?", "end": 1026.9}, {"start": 1026.9, "text": "或者说whose hat is it?", "end": 1029.94}, {"start": 1029.94, "text": "That is his hat.", "end": 1033.85}, {"start": 1033.85, "text": "That is his cap.", "end": 1037.97}, {"start": 1037.97, "text": "男人的。", "end": 1038.97}, {"start": 1038.97, "text": "他的。", "end": 1039.97}, {"start": 1039.97, "text": "His.", "end": 1042.71}, {"start": 1042.71, "text": "你们都做对了吗?", "end": 1044.72}, {"start": 1044.72, "text": "His.", "end": 1047.94}, {"start": 1047.94, "text": "你们会发现他的发音跟he蛮接近的。", "end": 1051.44}, {"start": 1051.44, "text": "He.", "end": 1052.44}, {"start": 1052.44, "text": "His.", "end": 1053.44}, {"start": 1053.44, "text": "That is his cap.", "end": 1054.44}, {"start": 1054.44, "text": "He's wearing a cap.", "end": 1056.44}, {"start": 1056.44, "text": "都做对了吧?", "end": 1057.44}, {"start": 1057.44, "text": "最后我们用一个场景来总结这一单元。", "end": 1062.1}, {"start": 1062.1, "text": "给你们一个小小的运用挑战。", "end": 1065.49}, {"start": 1065.49, "text": "介绍你全家福上的人并说明他所在的位置。", "end": 1069.49}, {"start": 1069.49, "text": "记不记得我们上节课有稍微点到过这个话题。", "end": 1073.49}, {"start": 1073.49, "text": "现在看着你的照片,", "end": 1075.49}, {"start": 1075.49, "text": "你要说你要把每个人说清楚。", "end": 1078.49}, {"start": 1078.49, "text": "我们假设中间是父母,", "end": 1080.49}, {"start": 1080.49, "text": "两边是孩子好了。", "end": 1082.49}, {"start": 1082.49, "text": "那我就会说", "end": 1086.0}, {"start": 1086.0, "text": "Those are my family members.", "end": 1088.0}, {"start": 1088.0, "text": "那些。", "end": 1089.0}, {"start": 1089.0, "text": "Those.", "end": 1090.0}, {"start": 1090.0, "text": "Right?", "end": 1091.0}, {"start": 1091.0, "text": "总不能图上只有一个人吧。", "end": 1093.0}, {"start": 1093.0, "text": "如果只有一个人,", "end": 1094.0}, {"start": 1094.0, "text": "或者说是只有你一个,", "end": 1096.0}, {"start": 1096.0, "text": "你就可以说that。", "end": 1098.0}, {"start": 1098.0, "text": "但这里有好多个。", "end": 1101.36}, {"start": 1101.36, "text": "所以是those。", "end": 1103.98}, {"start": 1103.98, "text": "Those people。", "end": 1104.98}, {"start": 1104.98, "text": "那些人。", "end": 1105.98}, {"start": 1105.98, "text": "当然你嫌太麻烦了。", "end": 1108.48}, {"start": 1108.48, "text": "不想说那些,", "end": 1109.48}, {"start": 1109.48, "text": "只想说他们。", "end": 1111.48}, {"start": 1111.48, "text": "Right?", "end": 1112.48}, {"start": 1112.48, "text": "直接指代他们。", "end": 1113.48}, {"start": 1113.48, "text": "不强调这里那里。", "end": 1115.91}, {"start": 1115.91, "text": "那就说我们最早学的。", "end": 1117.91}, {"start": 1117.91, "text": "They。", "end": 1120.11}, {"start": 1120.11, "text": "记得吗?", "end": 1121.64}, {"start": 1121.64, "text": "一群幼儿园的孩子。", "end": 1123.64}, {"start": 1123.64, "text": "They。", "end": 1125.58}, {"start": 1125.58, "text": "他们。", "end": 1126.58}, {"start": 1126.58, "text": "我不强调他们在这还是那。", "end": 1128.58}, {"start": 1128.58, "text": "我不用those are these。", "end": 1129.58}, {"start": 1129.58, "text": "我直接说they。", "end": 1130.58}, {"start": 1130.58, "text": "They are my family.", "end": 1133.11}, {"start": 1133.11, "text": "They are my parents.", "end": 1135.11}, {"start": 1135.11, "text": "This is my father.", "end": 1138.98}, {"start": 1138.98, "text": "That is my mother.", "end": 1140.98}, {"start": 1140.98, "text": "这里你要是想做一个位置的区分,", "end": 1142.98}, {"start": 1142.98, "text": "你就可以用this or that。", "end": 1144.98}, {"start": 1144.98, "text": "当然你不想再强调this or that。", "end": 1148.98}, {"start": 1148.98, "text": "那你更简单。", "end": 1150.98}, {"start": 1150.98, "text": "They are my parents。", "end": 1152.98}, {"start": 1152.98, "text": "父母。", "end": 1154.61}, {"start": 1154.61, "text": "He is my father.", "end": 1155.61}, {"start": 1155.61, "text": "She is my mother.", "end": 1157.61}, {"start": 1157.61, "text": "是不是也可以。", "end": 1158.61}, {"start": 1158.61, "text": "所以从功能出发来思考这个代词,", "end": 1162.17}, {"start": 1162.17, "text": "你就很明白了。", "end": 1163.17}, {"start": 1163.17, "text": "我们说I, he, her, his。", "end": 1166.73}, {"start": 1166.73, "text": "都是指男男女女。", "end": 1167.73}, {"start": 1167.73, "text": "Right?", "end": 1168.73}, {"start": 1168.73, "text": "我们说this, that, these, those。", "end": 1171.73}, {"start": 1171.73, "text": "是强调方位。", "end": 1172.73}, {"start": 1172.73, "text": "这样区分就很清楚了。", "end": 1175.61}, {"start": 1175.61, "text": "好。", "end": 1176.61}, {"start": 1176.61, "text": "那作为总结,", "end": 1177.61}, {"start": 1177.61, "text": "你想强调这个人是我哥哥。", "end": 1180.61}, {"start": 1180.61, "text": "This is my brother.", "end": 1183.23}, {"start": 1183.23, "text": "He is on my father's left.", "end": 1185.23}, {"start": 1185.23, "text": "在我爸爸的左边。", "end": 1187.23}, {"start": 1187.23, "text": "This is my brother.", "end": 1189.23}, {"start": 1189.23, "text": "He is on my father's left.", "end": 1191.23}, {"start": 1191.23, "text": "This is my mother.", "end": 1193.79}, {"start": 1193.79, "text": "She is on my father's right.", "end": 1196.79}, {"start": 1196.79, "text": "是不是慢慢你都能听懂了。", "end": 1198.79}, {"start": 1198.79, "text": "This is my brother on the left.", "end": 1201.35}, {"start": 1201.35, "text": "This is my mother on the right.", "end": 1203.35}, {"start": 1203.35, "text": "I am by my father too。", "end": 1207.33}, {"start": 1207.33, "text": "所以用刚刚这些简单的代词,", "end": 1210.27}, {"start": 1210.27, "text": "你不仅能强调方位,", "end": 1212.27}, {"start": 1212.27, "text": "你还能强调性别,", "end": 1214.27}, {"start": 1214.27, "text": "你还能强调单数和符数。", "end": 1216.27}, {"start": 1216.27, "text": "你的英语已经进步很多了。", "end": 1219.27}, {"start": 1219.27, "text": "不要急。", "end": 1220.27}, {"start": 1220.27, "text": "这些概念我们还会不断的去回顾。", "end": 1223.27}, {"start": 1223.27, "text": "你以后还会碰到好多次。", "end": 1225.83}, {"start": 1225.83, "text": "这是你们的第二次运用。", "end": 1227.83}, {"start": 1227.83, "text": "还有三次。", "end": 1229.55}]}